    relatedArticles: ["python-for-log-and-packet-analysis", "wireshark-and-the-capture-stack", "capture-points-before-packets", "bigip-tcpdump-syntax", "reading-a-bigip-capture", "bigip-tcpdump-safety"], // the Learn articles that teach it (sweep 9D)
